# tests/.gitignore excludes *.wav and *.ogg — scratch outputs the test binaries
# write. Regression seeds are SOURCE, and the parent pattern silently swallowed
# them: `ogg-huge-comment-count.ogg` was crafted, documented in README.md, and
# named in ci.yml's copy step, but `git add` ignored it and nobody noticed, so
# the "deterministic gate" replayed an empty set from the day it was written
# (`git log --all -- tests/fuzz/regressions/*.ogg` finds no add). Re-include the
# audio extensions here so a seed cannot be lost that way again.
!*.ogg
!*.wav
!*.webm
!*.au
!*.amr
!*.m4a
!*.mp3
!*.flac
